    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "30 Grange Wood is an exceptionally attractive extended (c.1978) family home, offering approximately 162 sq.m. / 1,744 sq.ft. of bright and well-proportioned accommodation in this highly sought-after, family-friendly development just off Grange Road.\r\nDesigned with family living in mind, the property boasts superb reception areas that provides excellent flexibility of layout, ideal for growing families and those at every stage of life.\r\n30 Grange Wood will particularly appeal to purchasers already living locally who may be seeking to trade up from a smaller home, while remaining within this well-established and convenient neighbourhood.\r\nThe location is excellent, with easy access to Dundrum Town Centre, the LUAS, the M50 and the wonderful amenities of Marlay Park. A wide selection of highly regarded schools and colleges are nearby, including Rathfarnham Educate Together, Divine Word National School, Gaelcholáiste an Phiarsaigh, Loreto Beaufort, St Mary's National School, Mount Anville Secondary School, Wesley College and University College Dublin.\r\nA particular feature of the property is the beautifully private, south-facing walled rear garden, which enjoys excellent sunshine throughout the day and provides an ideal setting for outdoor dining, entertaining and family enjoyment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION\r\nHallway with understairs Storage. Tiled floor.\r\nLIVING ROOM/DINING ROOM\r\nFeature Sandstone fireplace. Double glass panelled door to\r\nFAMILY/SUN ROOM\r\nRadiator cover. Double doors to private South facing, private garden. Velux windows. Door to\r\nKITCHEN/BREAKFAST ROOM\r\nExcellent range of built in wardrobes, worktop, sink unit, NEFF cooker, Siemans Hobb, Siemans fridge/freezer, etc. Double doors to rear garden. \r\n\r\nSTUDY\r\nExcellent storage and book shelving. Sliding door to front.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\nLanding – hot press off.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1 (rear)\r\nBuilt in wardrobes. Storage. Vanity basin.\r\nBEDROOM 2 (front)\r\nBuilt in wardrobes and drawers.\r\nBEDROOM 3 (front)\r\nBuilt in wardrobes and dressing table.\r\nBEDROOM 4 (rear)\r\nBuilt in wardrobes. Parana pine ceiling. \r\nENSUITE BATHROOM\r\nShower unit, wc and whb.\r\nLARGE MAIN BATHROOM \r\nBath (shower attachment) , wc and vanity basin. Good storage.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\nSouth facing and private rear patio and garden. \r\nBlock built shed divided in 2. Boiler house.\r\nParking in front for several cars."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "FEATURES\r\nEXCEPTIONALLY QUIET, FAMILY FRIENDLY LOCATION \r\nOIL FIRED CENTRAL HEATING\r\nDOUBLE GLAZED WINDOWS\r\nTIMBER  FLOORS\r\nSOUTH FACING SECLUDED REAR GARDEN\r\nOFF STREET PARKING TO THE FRONT\r\nEXCELLENT CHOICE OF SCHOOLS, PRIMARY AND POST PRIMARY, CLOSE BY\r\nBESIDE MARLAY PARK AND M50\r\nCLOSE TO RATHFARNHAM VILLAGE\r\nDUNDRUM TOWN CENTRE AND LUAS IN DUNDRUM"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C"
      }
